  "details": "For example pressing the right arrow currently increases the amount of ranks blocked but decreases the minimum rank. This makes it slightly confusing when navigating to the desired minimum rank to display.\n\nThe arrows should reflect the increase or decrease in minimum rank, not the amount of ranks being blocked.\n\nEDIT: After thinking about this a little bit it comes down to the rank names and how I visualise them. When you go left to right with arrows I presumed the list was the same order as the documentation. So my brain died trying to figure out if I was going in a direction along that order versus going up or down in ranks versus how many ranks are being blocked.\n\nThe option to choose should have probably been a drop down in descending order of performance to help identify a rank that is below another. ",
